{"_id":"621bd7b242fcfdc6b3d21aac","title":"Rake Remastered Gui","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77ffd","gameId":2413927524,"name":"The Rake REMASTERED","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"2413927524-the-rake-remastered","path":"/game/2413927524-the-rake-remastered","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":2413927524},"slug":"Rake-Remastered-Gui_935","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":39237,"executes":246,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/5238dfdc4865b6fd228d6cd874775864/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/5238dfdc4865b6fd228d6cd874775864/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/5238dfdc4865b6fd228d6cd874775864/500/280/Image/Jpeg","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/5238dfdc4865b6fd228d6cd874775864/500/280/Image/Jpeg"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2022-02-27T19:57:38.459Z","updatedAt":"2022-02-27T19:57:38.459Z","lastBump":"2022-02-27T19:57:38.459Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://gist.githubusercontent.com/nknownhacker/6e4486b679c9af96842c4fb4d62219cd/raw/ba5d3f614f5447615d5ed9780d3f4415ccfc4257/gistfile1.txt'))()","features":"made by https://v3rmillion.net/member.php?action=profile&uid=606344\n\ndeveloper note: \nI'm giving this away because I'm bored of holding onto it.\n\nFirst off\n\nq allows you to run defying the laws of stamina, you can also press it again to go slow\nx allows you to run at a dangerous speed because you would start getting picked up by the anticheat so don't use this for much unless in situation like blood hour rake chasing you\nb enables and disables the gui\nL gives you fullbright and disables it aswell\np destroys the script and gui\n\nnow onto the commands\n/e Music [ID] -- plays a sound unlooped on your character\n/e clear -- destroys all sounds in your character\n/e [WeaponName] -- if someone else is using the script they can also see your stunstick change when you use this command instead of the buttons which is changed only for you\n\nfeatures\nStun Stick modifier you can use the buttons on the right when you have a stun stick out to change it to whatever you take a liking to\nModifies your Head Lamp so its rainbow and tranquil\nMusic Player, input a id and it will play the sound looped\nRake Esp\nScrap Esp\nLootbox Esp\nFlare Gun Esp\nLootbox Loot Finder\nTime Teller -- Tells you the time ingame\nRake Info Teller -- Tells Health Info and Distance\nRake Detector -- Tells you when Rake is within 100 Studs, I created this cause I was tired of rake sneaking up on my ass when I was writing code\nThe sounds also get modified so in the script you can change the ids in the randomchase table\n\nalright thats all the features here's loadstring","tags":["the rake"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"61d11cfaefaafc47a4ee416d","username":"garfieldcatto","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61d11cfaefaafc47a4ee416d-1658110104022.gif"},"status":"offline","id":"61d11cfaefaafc47a4ee416d","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":1000000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61d11cfaefaafc47a4ee416d-1658110104022.gif"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T18:18:26.024Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4e26e","editBy":{"_id":"61d11cfaefaafc47a4ee416d","username":"garfieldcatto","status":"offline","id":"61d11